- (gunfire stops)

965
01:04:23.943 --> 01:04:25.709
- (gunshot)
- (grunts)

966
01:04:25.711 --> 01:04:27.646
(panting)

967
01:04:37.489 --> 01:04:38.889
(panting)

968
01:04:38.891 --> 01:04:40.826
